{"id":"n75320-1-6","stage":4,"title":"조선업 · 造船业","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75320-1-6-1","ko":"한국의 배를 만드는 조선업의 기술 수준은 어떤가요?","zh":"韩国的造船业技术水平如何？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한국의","meaning":"韩国","explanation":"한국：韩国；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"한국의","audio":"/audio/7347e8613548d64ec96f.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한국의","audio":"/audio/7347e8613548d64ec96f.mp3"}},{"text":"배를","meaning":"船","explanation":"배：船；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29729","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배를","audio":"/audio/8d62500623ac2523536a.mp3"}},{"text":"만드는","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만드는","audio":"/audio/5ace588de32e5a309a75.mp3"}},{"text":"조선업의","meaning":"造船业","explanation":"조선업：造船业；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"조선업","audio":"/audio/0e04176ccf9b985c5e04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75320","senseId":"1","lemma":"조선업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조선업의","audio":"/audio/60f930b86edde4e70243.mp3"}},{"text":"기술","meaning":"技术","explanation":"기술：技术。","readings":[{"term":"기술","audio":"/audio/a78cee47656be418e747.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73355","senseId":"1","lemma":"기술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기술","audio":"/audio/a78cee47656be418e747.mp3"}},{"text":"수준은","meaning":"水准，水平","explanation":"수준：水准，水平；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"수준","audio":"/audio/7a73f940083f5fda6132.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15767","senseId":"1","lemma":"수준","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수준은","audio":"/audio/f89041af33